This agreement is entered into on March 15, 2024, between Thinkplus Investments Limited (hereinafter referred to as the "Lender"), a company incorporated under the laws of England and Wales with registered number 12345678 and registered office at 90 Pall Mall, London SW1Y 5NQ, Tech Innovations Limited (hereinafter referred to as the "Borrower"), a company incorporated under the laws of England and Wales with registered number 87654321 and registered office at 123 High Street, London EC1V 6BH, and Innovate Solutions Limited (hereinafter referred to as the "Guarantor"), a company incorporated under the laws of England and Wales with registered number 23456789 and registered office at 45 New Broad Street, London EC2M 1JH.

